VAL_ 513 STATE 5 "FAULT_TIMEOUT" 4 "FAULT_STARTUP" 3 "FAULT_SCE" 2 "FAULT_SEND" 1 "FAULT_BAD_CHECKSUM" 0 "NO_FAULT" ;

CM_ "Kia Ray EV comma pedal uses the standard 0x200/0x201 rolling counter and CRC8 protocol. GAS_COMMAND raw neutral 264/497 reads 8.2875 command units. The low-pedal curve joins the fitted scale at 24.07 percent demand. At the 0.80 cap the rounded tracks are 937/1860. Disabled frames carry two raw zeros. The ray_1800_M100 firmware applies its 1.8x minus 100 transform to physical ADC inputs and consumes command tracks directly as DAC counts. Driver override uses raw GAS_SENSOR tracks.";
